'' LEN / SIZEOF / TYPEOF read a LEADING 'NS.proc' as the bare name in view, as fbc does:
'' 'len( NS.Twice( t ) )' calls the GLOBAL Twice, and 'sizeof( NS.Nw( ) )' measures the
'' global short. tiko called and measured NS's. Not the first token, the prefix stays.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/mir/src/len-ns-prefix.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered
'' EXPECT-OUT: call ptr TWICE(@t)
'' EXPECT-NOT: _ZN2NS5TWICEER8FBSTRING(@t)
'' EXPECT-OUT: const i64 2
'' EXPECT-OUT: call ptr _ZN2NS4KEEPER8FBSTRING(@t)
'' EXPECT-OUT: const i64 8
